Third-party notices
===================

Parts of this project are adapted from pi-jev-auto-mode
(https://github.com/jomatsu/pi-jev-auto-mode): the deterministic policy layer
and its command pattern catalogue (src/policy.ts), the tool call view and
redaction (src/call.ts), user intent extraction (src/intent.ts), threshold
composition (src/laya/decide.ts), settings validation (src/settings.ts), the
decision record renderer (src/records.ts) and the dialog preview bounding
(src/ui.ts).

pi-jev-auto-mode's command pattern catalogue is in turn adapted from
@nilskluewer/pi-auto-permission-gate
(https://github.com/nilskluewer/pi-auto-permission-gate). Both projects are MIT
licensed. The pi-jev-auto-mode notice follows.

